{"seq":2,"slug":"provider-side","title":"Provider 侧工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/provider-side","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"event-catalog-design","title":"事件目录与 Schema 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/provider-side/event-catalog-design","wordCount":1350,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"fanout-delivery-engine","title":"扇出投递引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/provider-side/fanout-delivery-engine","wordCount":1504,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"rate-limiting-backoff","title":"限流与退避策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/provider-side/rate-limiting-backoff","wordCount":1584,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# Provider 侧工程\n\n当你的系统作为 webhook 的发送方时，需要解决三个核心问题：定义清晰的事件目录让消费者能按需订阅、构建可靠的扇出引擎将事件投递到成百上千个端点、以及在消费者端点降级时合理限流避免雪崩。\n\n本章从事件 schema 设计出发，讲解如何构建一个支持多租户、具备故障隔离能力的投递引擎，并深入 provider 侧限流与退避的工程实践。\n"}